# Uploads belong to the media volume, not to git. The banner artwork landed
# here once and was committed by accident: a tracked file under an upload
# directory is a trap, because `deploy.sh update` refuses to run when a tracked
# file on the server differs. Banners and photos are uploaded from
# /system-admin/, which writes straight into the volume.
